        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Man's red woollen coat (broadcloth/<i>draps fin</i>) and waistcoat lined with pale-blue silk twill (<i>serge de soie</i>). A small running stitch outlines the edge of the coat, waistcoat and their pocket flaps. Buttons covered in red foil and embroidered with silver spangles and silver thread. The button band is strengthened with some kind of stiffening which is sewn down about 4.5cm from the outer edge with a similarly expert running stitch which is nearly invisible."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3ed39219-d13a-3bfa-8c8a-1fd47159511e> .

